Chord trainer
Code written from scratch. Ideas inspired by Chord Nebula (Behnam Khanbeigi).
The same list is shown in the app on the "Лицензии" page (/licenses).

Sound banks
-----------
Shipped as separate files in public/soundfonts/ and loaded at runtime; they are not
compiled into the app. Not stored in git: run `npm run soundfont` to download them.

